<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD CLOSE OF PLAY SCORE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD CLOSE OF PLAY SCORE.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play score in a four-day</p>
<p>Sheffield Shield match on Monday.</p>
<p>In Adelaide (third day): South Australia 293 (Darren Lehmann</p>
<p>76, Brad Young 56 not out, Jamie Siddons 55) and 127-6. Tasmania</p>
<p>425 (Jamie Cox 94, Dene Hills 59, Daniel Marsh 58, Mark Atkinson</p>
<p>58).</p>
